<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01389#audience_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme is designed for a broad, general internet audience familiar with internet humor, self-deprecating jokes, and pet-related content. The humor relies on relatable, everyday activities (taking a cat to the mall, brunch time) and the ironic use of the word 'confession,' which appeals to users who appreciate absurdist and lighthearted content. There are no specific demographic, cultural, or community markers that target a narrow group; the content is universally accessible and relies on common experiences like pet ownership and weekend leisure."@en .
