<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01389#self_deprecating_humor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Self-deprecating humor involves making fun of oneself, often to appear humble or relatable. The meme uses this technique by presenting a quirky personal ritual as a 'confession,' which is a humorous way to highlight the absurdity of the behavior without targeting anyone else."@en .
